{"id":"ebb6jipwghi78670qas446rmc","title":"我发表论文里的五张照片","originalTitle":null,"summary":"作者在 1989 年与导师周性伟老师在 IEEE TASSP 发表论文时首次公开刊登照片（图 1），随后 20 年间在多篇论文中使用同一张照片（图 2）。随着科研人员数量激增，期刊论文数量激增，作者认为论文照片的重要性逐渐减弱。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3395313&do=blog&id=1561756"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T01:28:13.412Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T01:28:13.412Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":20,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}